    "Restore-target path cases shared by the server-side check and the backup helper (#12671).",
    "Read by packages/shared/src/utils/restoreTargetRoot.test.ts and agent/internal/backup/restore_target_vectors_test.go.",
    "expect.<host>: how classifyRestoreTarget(target, host) classifies the target for a device of that kind: root, needs-confirmation (a form the check cannot reduce to a folder on a local volume) or not-root. With the device kind unknown, the server uses the strictest of the three; root and needs-confirmation both require allowOverwriteOriginals.",
    "guard.<host>: how the helper's guard (parsePathKey) reads the target on that host: root, folder or unreadable (the guard then refuses the restore). Recorded as the guard reads it; general alias detection (volume GUID, device or loopback-share spellings of a drive) is #12668.",
    "Change an expectation only together with the code on both sides."
